## Tuition Fee Loan

<% if eligible_for_nhs_bursary == "yes" %>
  If your course is eligible for an [NHS bursary](https://www.nhsbsa.nhs.uk/nhs-bursary), you cannot get a Tuition Fee Loan from Student Finance England. If you get the bursary, your tuition fees will be paid directly to your university by the NHS.
<% else %>
  You could get a <%= format_money(max_tuition_fee_amount_lle, pounds_only: true) %> [Tuition Fee Loan](<%= tuition_fee_url %>) each year to help pay your course tuition fees. This is the maximum loan you can get, based on the number of credits you're studying.

  Depending on which course you’re studying and how much your course provider is charging, your Tuition Fee Loan may not be enough to cover the full cost of your course.

  <% if studied_before %>
    If you’ve studied before, your loan might be less. Find out how [the amount you're eligible for is worked out](/student-finance-on-or-after-1-january-2027/eligibility).
  <% end %>
<% end %>
